    <summary>Live network upload and download speed on your Windows taskbar, with Gaming HUD and multi-WAN support.</summary>
    <description>NetSpeed Boss shows your real-time download and upload speed on the Windows taskbar, next to the clock, alongside a full network and hardware monitor.

### Features
- **Taskbar speed meter** that blends into Windows light and dark mode and hides for full-screen apps
- **Dual-WAN / load-balancing awareness &amp; built-in Speed Test** showing combined speeds across active adapters and per-adapter breakdowns
- **Gaming HUD overlay** with background-only transparency, crisp opaque text, RAG thresholds, FPS, CPU/GPU temps &amp; load, VRAM usage, RAM, Ping, and Down/Up speeds
- **Live speed graph &amp; System Info tab** with adapter link details, CPU/GPU/VRAM/memory telemetry, and top downloading apps
- **Per-app network view &amp; data usage history** for daily, monthly, and custom date ranges with CSV export and optional monthly data cap alerts
- **Floating always-on-top mini meter** with edge snapping and optional click-through mode</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/merchanthasan2/NetSpeedBoss/releases/tag/v1.3.1</releaseNotes>
